This build is used for running the mission [[gww:Sanctum_Cay|Sanctum Cay]] in both Normal Mode and Hard Mode in under 10 minutes.
<br>It utilizes "Make Haste" to accelerate the Restless spirit, and glitches the end fight with SoH, resulting in the fastest possible mission clear.
<br><br>
Great for [[gww:Zaishen Mission|Zaishen Mission]] days. Also great for players who are running this mission to unlock [[gww:Amnoon_Oasis|Amnoon Oasis]].

'''The build can be Any/A''', however the bonus becomes significantly more time consuming, and a conset may be required in Hardmode due to shadow form's short duration and more difficult timing.

