== Consumables ==
* '''Alcohol and Cupcake are required.'''
* War supplies, Corn, apple, and Egg are useful and make the mission significantly easier.
* Conset is encouraged in Hardmode, but is not needed with experience.

== Equipment ==
* Full [[gww:Blessed_Insignia|Blessed]] Armor
* +20% [[gww:of_enchanting|enchanting spear]], Q9/16AR command shield +45hp [[gww:Of_Devotion|While enchanted]]
