== Usage ==
=== Getting to Vizier ===
* At the start of the mission, Collect the Scepter of Orr from [[gww:Evennia|Evenia]].
** You must keep the scepter with you at all times. While carrying it you will have +1 energy regen, but your enchantments will not last as long.
** If not using conset you will need to drop the scepter to maintain Shadowform.
* Run to the bonus NPC (Restless Spirit) and talk with him. You will know he is following you once he speaks in All chat.
* Use "Make Haste!" on the restless spirit to make him move faster. Try to hold aggro for him away from walls so he does not get stuck.
** Note: He is invulnerable and foes do not target him, but he has a very large collision hitbox that foes can't walk through.
* Run to the Vizier spawn, activate Shadow of Haste at the base of the hill. 
** Make sure the bonus NPC is past the gate, as you'll need to talk to him after Vizier.
* Give the scepter to vizier ASAP to avoid him getting into combat. YOU DO NOT WANT TO KILL THE VIZIER HERE OR YOU WILL BE STUCK IN THE MISSION WITH NO WAY TO SUCCEED.
*End Shadow of Haste by using another stance. Then talk to the bonus NPC once he has the quest symbol above his head.

=== Glitching Vizier/boat ===
* Follow the mission path, bring the bonus NPC along if doing bonus.
* Once you arrive at the Vizier Safe Spot, use HoS/Vipers to jump down the ledge. Or Use Death's Charge if the enemy group is nearby.
** DO NOT WALK IN THE YELLOW CIRCLE OR THE GLITCH IS FAILED.
* At the fork in the road, use Shadow of Haste with Dwarven Stability to give it extended duration.
* Head to ship and trigger Vizier's spawn on the dock. NOTE THE TIME.
** Optional: Use HoS/Vipers to jump up and down the hillside quicker.
*Once Vizier is trigger, go to the spot to end SoH. Then run to the Vizier Safe Spot to pop the Vizier before enemies kill him.
** Once the vizier is in the safe spot, he will no longer be able to take damage but will continue to summon the bridge.
** He will disappear from the safespot after a few seconds. This is normal.
* Bring the Bonus NPC and lead him to the bonus location at the end of the mission.
* After it has been Approximately 2m 30s from the time you popped Vizier on the dock, you may cast your enchantments and get on the ship to end the mission.
** Note: Sometimes the ship is not ready. You may need to wait for the invisible wall to go down. Just keep running forward and do not get body blocked.


== Counters ==
* Killing the Vizier at any of his spawn points.
** Bonus NPC getting stuck on locked chest (forced /resign and rego)
* Poor SoH placement.
* General Bodyblock/desync causing the runner to die.
* Triggering the Safe spot early.

